                <pb facs="0221" n="205" xml:id="pg205"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>The National Security Council, in its report No. 45/1 of April 15, recommended to
                    President Truman that he direct the Secretary of State to undertake negotiations
                    with the British Government regarding provision of funds for construction of
                    airfields in the United Kingdom and in the Cairo–Suez area. The text of the
                    report is printed in <ref target="frus:frus1949v01/pg_285">volume I, page
                        285</ref>. The President approved the recommendation on April 18; see
                    footnote 3, <ref target="frus:frus1949v01/pg_285">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">ibid</hi>
                    </ref>.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
